            "text": "Praveen Prem\nPraveen Prem (21 April 1984) is a south Indian film actor who began his acting career in 2010 in the Malayalam language film \"Kadha Thudarunnu\". His first major role in Malayalam cinema came through the movie \"Tournament – Play & Replay\" directed by Lal in which he played Usman Ali. ",
            "source_role": "document",
            "source_message_indices": [],
            "source_hash": "e7d02ac23445a00a0d765e2a53140f03dcafcca2db22d5e2b138a346ebd18af6",
