          "s20": {
            "id": "s20",
            "doc_id": "hotpotqa:8349",
            "start": 297,
            "end": 580,
            "text": "Prem next appeared as several comedy characters in Malayalam movies, taking on the role of the hero Kiran in the 2013 movie \"Crocodile Love Story\". Prem made his debut in the Tamil film industry in 2014 after director O.S. Ravi cast him as the male lead in the movie \"Dummy Tappasu\".",
