            "start": 0,
            "end": 196,
            "text": "Sumona Chakravarti\nSumona Chakravarti is an Indian film and Television actress who began her acting career at the age of 10 through Aamir Khan and Manisha Koirala starrer \"Mann\" in the year 1999. ",
            "source_role": "document",
            "source_message_indices": [],
            "source_hash": "aa0f76a5a6fe55ae7b1252342b83a1f540193258a12097a44ccbfaca75380bcf",
            "premise_group_ids": [
