            "source_id": "src_308943cdee0dc02e3ebc36fc"
          },
          "s22": {
            "id": "s22",
            "doc_id": "hotpotqa:2065",
            "start": 196,
            "end": 592,
            "text": "In the next few years she did quite a few television shows but her big breakthrough happened in 2011 when she played the role of Natasha in \"Bade Achhe Lagte Hain\", a television show produced by Balaji Telefilms. In the following year she participated in the comedy show \"Kahani Comedy Circus Ki\" on Sony Entertainment Television with Kapil Sharma and the duo emerged as the winners of the show. ",
            "source_role": "document",
            "source_message_indices": [],
            "source_hash": "aa0f76a5a6fe55ae7b1252342b83a1f540193258a12097a44ccbfaca75380bcf",
