            "start": 821,
            "end": 1120,
            "text": "After wrapping up \"Comedy Nights with Kapil\" on Colors TV, Kapil Sharma began his new show called The Kapil Sharma Show on Sony Entertainment Television (India) in April 2016 in which Sumona Chakravarti is seen playing the role of Sarla Gulati, a girl deeply in love with her neighbour Kapil Sharma.",
