            "doc_id": "hotpotqa:4392",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 374,
            "text": "Sajid Yahiya\nSajid Yahiya is an Indian film actor and director known for his work in Malayalam cinema. He made his acting debut in \"Collector\" directed by Anil C Menon. His second movie,\" Friday\" was the directorial debut of Lijin Jose. He was then approached by Roopesh Peethambaran to play a role in Theevram. After this, he acted on \"Kaashh\", \"Arikil Oraal\", and \"Amen\". ",
